{"uid":"a16e9f4fd8d232f1","name":"test_run_detail_approach_history_expands_a_previous_approach","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub#test_run_detail_approach_history_expands_a_previous_approach","historyId":"8fbef7c8c24f0ff5234694105e9d2b0e","time":{"start":1791979177484,"stop":1791979203439,"duration":25955},"description":"Task 021 (#24): every previous approach `_archive_approach` froze into\n    `approaches/NN/` is one collapsed row away, most recent last, expanding to\n    that approach's OWN task table and its OWN notes.md/review-findings.md --\n    never the live plan's, and never another approach's. A run still on its\n    first approach (nothing archived) shows no history panel at all.\n\n    Drives the real accordion (`<details>`/`<summary>`) with a real click, and\n    proves the panel consumes only the server's `GET /api/runs/<id>/approaches`\n    and `GET /api/runs/<id>/approaches/<n>` -- no client-side counting.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 021 (#24): every previous approach <code>_archive_approach</code> froze into<br />\n<code>approaches/NN/</code> is one collapsed row away, most recent last, expanding to<br />\nthat approach's OWN task table and its OWN notes.md/review-findings.md --<br />\nnever the live plan's, and never another approach's. A run still on its<br />\nfirst approach (nothing archived) shows no history panel at all.</p>\n<pre><code>Drives the real accordion (`&lt;details&gt;`/`&lt;summary&gt;`) with a real click, and\nproves the panel consumes only the server's `GET /api/runs/&lt;id&gt;/approaches`\nand `GET /api/runs/&lt;id&gt;/approaches/&lt;n&gt;` -- no client-side counting.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791978627538,"stop":1791978627538,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount